WEBVTT

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.210
Sa... w.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:25.790
Saw...

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.690
Next time I won't hesitate.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.810
I drank too much.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:47.940
<i>Everyone was crying</i>

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.400
<i>Like a star burning blue</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.780
<i>Where will we go? What will we see?</i>

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:59.580
<i>We're all going to change, though.</i>

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.000
<i>I don't need it, don't want it.</i>

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.110
<i>I've already given up on it</i>

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:20.770
<i>After so many sad farewells</i>

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.150
<i>And "take cares"</i>

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:28.470
<i>I want to like the present more than the past, 
the future more than the present.</i>

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.560
<i>Gradually my values have changed</i>

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:36.030
<i>I felt more grown up the more they wore away</i>

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:41.920
<i>Lies and betrayals 
are practically civilities</i>

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:45.420
<i>Everyone ages</i>

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.900
<i>But what about the star burning blue?</i>

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:52.240
<i>Our likes and dislikes</i>

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:55.840
<i>They'll all change at some point</i>

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:58.710
<i>A worn-out savior</i>

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:00.390
<i>A medal in a dirty ditch</i>

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:04.220
<i>I don't want to overlook 
their faint glimmers of light</i>

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:08.020
<i>I hear the sound still ringing from them</i>

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:13.540
<i>Let's move on a bit</i>

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.200
I feel awful.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.430
Sensei, are you okay?

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:22.700
<b>Episode 5: The Knight, Shinonome Hangetsu</b>

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:23.540
Do I look okay?

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:25.880
Being an adult sure is rough.

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:28.530
You should just not drink 
if you're going to end up like that.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.550
You come from a family of drunks,

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:33.380
so one day you'll end up 
like this too, Sami.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:38.870
Will I really?

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.360
You will.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.560
Oh, he's asleep.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:50.380
Hey, Yuuhi, the princess is here.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.040
Oh, it's all right.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.440
M-Mmn...

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:54.810
Welcome.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:56.340
What's the matter?

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.170
Sorry for waking you.

00:02:58.170 --> 00:02:59.850
I was bored, so I dropped in.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:04.210
Oh, this author's a friend of my father.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.530
Oh, yeah, your father's an author, right?

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:09.570
What kind of books does he write?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.920
He's best known for 
the <i>Hell Knifehand</i> Series.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.880
Huh? You mean he's Semi Shigure-sensei?

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.590
You know him?

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.050
Hell Knifehand vol 1-11

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:20.050
I own every volume!

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:23.990
So you actually have hobbies 
and things you like.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.040
Of course I do.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.160
I'm kind of happy one of those 
is my father's books.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.430
Well...

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:36.980
Hello.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.690
Ask Sami to go hang out 
with you somewhere now.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:51.410
Debauched Nymph

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.030
I don't mind, but what's going on?

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.780
<i>Don't worry about it, just go.</i>

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.280
<i>Also, make sure you don't 
come back before evening.</i>

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:50.790
Huh?

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:55.130
<i>This is a family-approved date!</i>

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.140
What's up? Why the funny face?

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.480
You said you were bored,

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.410
but is there anywhere you'd like to go?

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:04.880
Hmm, lunch?

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:06.830
Then, let's head out to a restaurant!

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:10.600
Okay, I'll go get changed, so wait 
for me outside my house.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.570
Okay, let's go.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.860
<i>I've never seen her wear that before.</i>

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.930
<i>Makes it feel like a date.</i>

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:35.000
Oh, I'll have one of 
everything on this page.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.130
Huh? Uh, sure.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.830
I'm going to use the restroom for a moment.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.540
Now, what should we do this afternoon?

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.130
You look like a buffoon.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:49.400
You always get this way 
when it comes to the princess.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:52.070
Dudun! Now, question one!

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.200
That voice...

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.140
Oh, it's the princess's father.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.780
What's your age and occupation?

00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:00.400
Twenty, college student.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.740
Dudun! Question two.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.530
Are you dating Samidare?

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:09.450
No, not yet.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.540
Not yet?!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.410
I-It's just one-sided affection from me!

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.050
Right now we're just friends 
with each other.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.510
Oh, did you know that once 
a woman views you a friend,

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.200
she no longer views you
as a potential romantic partner?

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.020
R-Really? First time I've heard that.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:30.650
Dudun! Question three.

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:32.120
<i>We're still doing this?</i>

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:35.280
Is there something you want 
to do or be in the future?

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.680
There's something I want to do.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.840
There's nothing I want to be for now.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:47.150
For now? Then what about 
when you were a kid?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:49.930
A detective...

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.170
It's not too late to start pursuing that.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.710
You do seem a little unstable,

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:00.080
but you're still young, and you'll probably 
mellow out as an adult.

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:02.660
As an adult...

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:06.760
I'm relieved to hear there's 
something you want to do.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:10.420
Well, I hope you'll 
continue being nice to Sami.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:16.480
Oh, can I get your autograph later?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.020
I own every volume of <i>Hell Knifehand</i>!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:23.840
Oh, right, tonight we're 
celebrating Samidare's birthday,

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.830
so Hisame is busy baking her cake right now,

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:28.310
but you should join us if you'd like to.

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:30.270
I'll give you an autograph then.

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:32.120
Huh? Her birthday?!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.740
She wants it to be a surprise,

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.910
so don't tell Samidare yet, okay?

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:36.700
Later.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:51.010
I'm back.

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:54.400
Huh? No one's home?

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:01.150
Happy birthday, Sami!

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.150
Happy birthday!

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:04.360
Oh, it's today?! I forgot!

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.470
Why are you here?

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:09.070
To help out, obviously.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.850
Sami, happy birthday.

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:13.140
Is this why you came home?

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:14.270
Yup.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:18.040
Thank you, everyone!

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:21.060
<i>Today's weather was nice.</i>

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:22.430
Happy birthday.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.000
<i>I ate my fill today.</i>

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.250
<i>I smiled a lot today.</i>

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:30.740
<i>I wish days like these would last forever.</i>

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.680
I'm so happy!

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:41.810
If you want, you could grow 
into an adult, too.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.440
An adult, huh?

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:52.010
Even if we stopped the Biscuit Hammer 
and I gave up on destroying the Earth,

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:54.990
I would never see such a future.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:56.430
Yeah.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:58.260
You remember me saying 
how I used to be sick?

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:01.690
Do you know why I'm so full of life now?

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:03.120
Right.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:06.580
The Spirit, Anima, is keeping me alive.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.930
Once this battle is over 
and Anima disappears,

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.490
I'll go back to only having a little time left.

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:16.650
So once this battle is finished,

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:20.160
I'll force the Earth to die 
with me before Anima disappears.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.180
<i>Well, yeah.</i>

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:25.240
Princess, that's...

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:28.000
Sorry, I'm not giving up on it.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.950
Hey, Yuu-kun.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.870
Die with me?

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.470
Gladly.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:51.840
<i>Soon after, something would happen
that would end the beginning of our battle.</i>

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:04.530
Hm?

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.930
Could I get your autograph?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.280
What about your jogging?

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.710
I'm about to start after this.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:15.760
Samidare and Amamiya-kun 
are both a little worrisome,

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:19.020
but with a hero of justice 
like you around them,

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:20.580
I'm sure they'll be okay.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.090
I can never be a hero of justice.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.750
I'm just an ordinary person.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:30.140
In that case, just be 
a good example of an adult.

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:32.650
"I want to be like him!"

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.890
Being a hero that can make 
kids believe that

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:37.550
is what being an adult is about.

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.600
Time for me to get going.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.760
Where to?

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.220
Wherever my whims take me!

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:53.690
It's the movie Hisame's been
wanting to see.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.370
Hmm, so cool.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:06.080
It's the movie Hisame's been
wanting to see.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:08.000
<i>Does this mean I've been 
accepted by her father?</i>

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:18.980
Hey.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:25.040
So you're practicing your jumps 
at night so you don't stand out?

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.700
Well, yes.

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:31.150
Looks like you're still not interested 
in taking lessons from me.

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:34.300
If you taught me now, 
it wouldn't be effective.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.580
Building up my fundamental stamina 
and strengthening my Holding Field

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:40.060
is plenty effective 
at raising my survivability.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.900
I see.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.870
By the way, want to drink?

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.130
Sounds nice.

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:47.000
Geh.

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:49.830
<i>Now, bring it on!</i>

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.190
<i>I will fight!</i>

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.540
<i>Because I love this planet!</i>

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.360
So, did you name your power?

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:03.460
Not yet. How did you come up 
with the name "Halberd" for yours?

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:07.350
It's the name of a weapon used 
by a famous Chinese general.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.010
I just thought it sounded cool.

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:10.970
Huh.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.820
Why not go with something 
that feels good to shout aloud?

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:17.110
Do I have to shout it?

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:21.900
<i>Magical Violence Gauntlet!</i>

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:26.240
See! You have to shout out finishing moves.

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:30.540
My power isn't offensive, 
so it's not really a finishing move.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.670
Halberd didn't have 
the strength to finish it either.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:38.510
Considering you defeated 
a golem all on your own,

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.750
your strength certainly measures up 
to the three mythic beast knights.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:47.600
Well, either way, you'll want 
to train your ability to run.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.520
I certainly am talented 
and a master of martial arts!

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:56.720
But I'm not some omnipotent being.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:58.740
There's a lot of things I can't do.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:01.940
If it's not too dangerous, 
I'll try to help you,

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:05.030
but if it puts me at risk,
I'll hold back.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:07.280
I thought you'd be the type 
to risk your life protecting others,

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.910
since you call yourself a hero of justice.

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.890
A hero of justice, huh?

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.220
You have talent.

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:22.310
One day you'll surpass me, 
your father, in martial arts!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:25.840
However, you must not use 
that strength for selfish ends!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:26.550
Yeah!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:29.260
Pet Superhero
<b>Parrotman</b>

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:29.260
Watch this for reference!

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:32.110
I had it instilled into me as a child.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:36.650
So I trained every day to become 
a hero of justice one day.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.410
What can I do to fly like Parrotman?!

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:47.460
T-Train hard.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.110
My father was an idiot.

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.450
But I...

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:04.020
I was an even bigger idiot.

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:06.820
I learned the truth.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:10.000
Humans can't fly!

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.840
Humans have limits!

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:16.620
After learning that, I gave up 
on being a hero of justice.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:18.030
All because you couldn't fly?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:22.350
Identify what you can and can't do.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:25.280
Then do your best within those boundaries.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.320
That's what life's about.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.670
Oh! That's a great saying!

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.710
I said something great, huh?

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.870
That's our Shinonome-dono!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.050
Right?

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:38.750
Yeah, you're great!

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:38.750
You get it!

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.410
Your best, huh?

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:46.890
Did Shinonome-dono's words stick with you?

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:52.850
Are you truly doing the best you can 
to protect our princess?

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.320
I don't know.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:59.400
Even taking an ineffective lesson 
would be better than nothing, right?

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:04.080
True. Since it's for our princess.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.280
Shinonome-san.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:16.450
I want to become stronger.

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.590
No matter how little.

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:20.600
A little would just be boring.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:24.170
You should aim to become 
a hero if you're doing it.

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.920
Especially since you can probably fly.

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:28.710
Shinonome-san,

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:33.240
what was the real reason you gave 
up on being a hero of justice?

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:35.390
I told you, didn't I? I couldn't fly.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:36.420
No!

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:41.230
A man as strong as you would never 
give up over a silly reason like that.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.440
When I was little,

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.990
I had a dog named Saw 
who was like an older brother.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:53.220
One day we were out for a walk when...

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.230
If I go now, I'll also—

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.710
Huh?

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:11.470
Saw!

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:24.770
"I'm not worthy to become 
a hero of justice."

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.480
That's what I thought then.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:32.820
Saw did what I couldn't.

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.920
He was my hero.

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.770
I don't know exactly what it is,

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:41.390
but I can tell you and Samidare-chan 
are plotting something

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:43.030
that would turn me against you.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.340
I won't ask you what it is, 
since I'll find out eventually.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:51.920
When that time comes, I'll defeat you two.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:53.760
So...

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:58.520
You need to grow stronger than me, 
so you can be Samidare-chan's hero.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.860
I will!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:03.400
If you do manage to surpass Hangetsu,

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:07.020
then I'll tell you what I remember 
of the previous final battle.

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:09.320
Previous?

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:14.790
A golem's hostility?

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:16.460
But it's different from usual.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.200
It doesn't feel like it's closing in.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:21.200
It's lying in wait for us, I'd say.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:22.390
Let's go.

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:24.500
This might be a chance for us 
to go on the offensive.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.140
Now and then isn't so bad, right?

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:46.770
There it is.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.980
Creepy thing.

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:53.700
It's fast!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.560
It's slow!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.500
Oh, it ran.

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:20.460
The golem withstood the princess's blow?

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.290
It's not here anymore.

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:27.860
Princess, let's split up.

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:28.690
Huh?

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:32.190
It'll be easier for you 
to search on your own, right?

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:34.400
I'll have Shinonome-san here with me.

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:39.110
I think splitting up like that gives us 
the best chances to find it and survive.

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:39.940
Yeah.

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:41.210
It's appropriate.

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.880
Then, I'll go on ahead.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:52.480
Excluding this one, 
I've encountered four golems so far.

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.710
All of them have targeted me.

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:56.660
Without paying the princess any attention.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:57.880
Oh?

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:01.280
It's retreating after 
the princess attacked it, too.

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.410
Those things have no intention 
of fighting the princess.

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:07.850
So the golem will come to us.

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:10.360
I see.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.070
You've studied them well.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:15.900
I hate to admit it, 
but I can't defeat a golem.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:21.030
And you won't end up wasting 
your life defending me, right?

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.010
Right.

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:28.370
I'm sorry for lowering 
everyone's chances of survival.

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.300
That's fine.

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:35.780
Becoming strong means 
recognizing your own weakness.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.290
Accept your weaknesses.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:42.220
I want to become strong.

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:45.060
You will be able to.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.410
I had a dream the other day.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:54.150
You were racing up a long flight of stairs,

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:56.770
and I was in your way.

00:18:58.210 --> 00:19:01.760
You were being tested as you fought me.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.810
And you were strong, surprisingly so.

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:08.580
But that's just a dream.

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.060
It was a dream,

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:14.920
but my talented intuition is telling me 
that you'll become strong.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.830
I'll be training you hard starting tomorrow,

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:19.150
so prepare yourself.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:20.800
Please do.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:24.150
It's not showing up.

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:28.420
I want to get home soon so I can buy 
some clothes for my date with Hisame-san.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.880
Saw, can you track it by scent or something?

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:31.810
It's Ludo!

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:34.030
A date?

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:35.060
You're relaxed.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.280
Yuuhi, above you!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.320
There it is!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:42.780
Halberd!

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:52.470
<i>My target's small, but I can hit it.</i>

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:58.570
Don't get too far from me!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:21.400
Halberd!

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.960
<i>Oh, shit!</i>

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.760
<i>I need to stand up and smile.</i>

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:46.000
<i>This is no time for a nap.</i>

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:50.510
<i>Oh, my. This isn't good.</i>

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:52.940
<i>That hit my organs hard, didn't it?</i>

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:58.150
Lu...do...

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:01.890
I know. I'll do as you asked.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:11.830
Your wish has been granted.

00:21:12.720 --> 00:21:16.090
Thank... you.

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:21.500
What should I wear out?

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:44.030
Saw, I did it, too.

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:00.860
Yuuhi, now Hangetsu's... is yours.

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:02.800
<i>Huh?</i>

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:04.960
<i>What is this?</i>

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:06.030
<i>Is this real?</i>

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:08.300
<i>No? Huh, blood?</i>

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>Is blood supposed to come out of the mouth?</i>

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:12.970
<i>Calm down, calm down, 
calm down, calm down!</i>

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:15.060
<i>I have to run fast!</i>

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:16.850
<i>I have to run! Move, legs!</i>

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:17.960
<i>Legs, legs!</i>

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:19.040
<i>Move!</i>

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:25.820
Yuuhi, jump! Hurry!

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:39.460
<i>The cause behind this sudden, 
large-scale landslide</i>

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:41.540
<i>is currently under investigation.</i>

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:46.360
<i>Furthermore, only one man 
died in this cave-in,</i>

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:50.320
<i>a 28 year old resident of the city 
named Shinonome Hangetsu-san.</i>

00:22:57.140 --> 00:23:05.310
<i>Looking back to those times, 
I always thought</i>

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:09.900
<i>It was hard to live life true to myself.</i>

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:13.570
<i>I recall those times.</i>

00:23:13.570 --> 00:23:17.120
<i>I wanted to forget, 
but now it's different.</i>

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:22.870
<i>Back then we stared at that same sky.</i>

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:29.500
<i>I'll never forget you, 
or our endless dreams</i>

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:36.010
<i>As we gazed at that sky 
after fate brought us together</i>

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:41.640
<i>I dream of us together, 
of those days I remember</i>

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:43.810
<i>But dreams end and I wake up</i>

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:48.360
<i>Seeking the future</i>

00:23:49.230 --> 00:23:54.450
<i>I reach for the light,</i>

00:23:55.280 --> 00:24:00.830
<i>Always thinking of you in</i>

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:13.800
<i>every little thing</i>

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:27.480
<b>Next Episode:
The Crow Knight and Shinonome Mikazuki</b>
